{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12114190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:6:1211419001:0":{"text":"So it was indeed a mechanism.\nSinbad, give me that blank sheet you found earlier.","source_cn":"果然是机关。\\n辛巴达，你把刚才找到的那张白纸给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5EF9AEC0AD2369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211419002:0":{"text":"Here you go. What are you planning to do? Blow your nose?","source_cn":"喏。你要干什么？擦鼻涕？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0942EC6D14BF0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211419003:0":{"text":"... This is serious business.","source_cn":"……我们不是能开玩笑的关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x332D6A79274C2F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211419004:0":{"text":"Yes, yes, you're the esteemed leader of the Carmine Whispers. You're always serious.","source_cn":"是是，您可是尊贵的血薇帮当家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FF6B7602EED111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211419005:1":{"text":"I'm not in the mood for jokes right now, so hush before I smack you.","source_cn":"我没心情和你斗嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE8B370F8A90246D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211419006:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I think there's something more to this blank sheet of paper.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF9198AFCBAC8B0B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I think there's something more to this blank sheet of paper.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, I think there's something more to this blank sheet of paper.","variant_male_record_index":"132181","variant_female_record_index":"132182","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:14::0":{"text":"Blank Page","source_cn":"空白的纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52406B157CD0D2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211419007:0":{"text":"If we heat it with the flame...","source_cn":"如果用火苗将它加热——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA491B34EA1D9F00","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If we heat it with the flame...","female":"If we heat it with the flame...","variant_male_record_index":"132183","variant_female_record_index":"132184","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"Wanted Poster","source_cn":"通缉令","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8106E922562BCCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211419008:0":{"text":"It's a... wanted poster!","source_cn":"这是……通缉令！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B6E46286734224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211419009:0":{"text":"\"<style=\"highlight\">Hodgkin... for the theft of the sacred artifact of the Bantus Empire</style>... wanted in all territories...\"","source_cn":"“<style=highlight>霍德希金窃取班题斯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AE62D55B1B171A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211419010:0":{"text":"Bantus... There's little information about it, but I do know that it's the mysterious empire of the Graveborns.","source_cn":"班题斯……关于那里的资料很稀少，我只知道，那是亡灵聚集...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4317CDD6FBB1C1BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211419011:0":{"text":"Hmph. I can't believe he's been flaunting that artifact around, when it was stolen.","source_cn":"哼，原来他手上的宝贝也是偷来的。借着偷来的东西，在别人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B110FDCB2294A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211419012:0":{"text":"If he's got the skills to steal a sacred artifact like that, we shouldn't underestimate him.","source_cn":"能偷走圣器，他有些本领。我们不能大意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09AEBEE27B26F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1211419013:0":{"text":"Alright, let's keep moving.","source_cn":"各位，继续前进吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32E533DC04855CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:12011429:0":{"text":"After solving the puzzle, eerie fire blocking your path disappears.","source_cn":"解开谜题后，拦路的诡异鬼火消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7429404242E7D85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}